Feature: KAN-8 - Malformed JSON and unsupported content types return HTTP 500 instead of a client error

  @R2
  Scenario: POST with non-JSON content type returns 415
    Given the request header "Content-Type" is "application/json"
    And the request body is:
      """
      {
        "sku" : "SKU-001",
        "name" : "Test Product",
        "price" : 9.99
      }
      """
    When I send a POST request to "/api/products"
    Then the response status is 415
    And the response body contains "not supported"

